      "content": "That's helpful detail. To make this really effective for the training, I want to see if we can get a bit more specific about the \"red flags.\" \n\nIf we're looking at these groups through a lens of crime prevention, are there certain patterns or specific types of high-risk behaviors—like suspicious movements or certain ways of grouping up—that statistically show up more often with these demographics? I'm trying to help officers distinguish between someone just being loud/assertive and someone who is actually exhibiting behaviors commonly associated with criminal intent in these specific communities.",
